#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:43
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kcalc; is a calculator for &kde;. In the simple mode it can be used for "
"basic arithmetic operations, but provides advanced modes for scientific, "
"statistical and numeral system calculations."
msgstr ""
"&kcalc; je kalkulator za &kde;. U jednostavnom režimu može se koristiti za "
"osnovne aritmetičke operacije, ali pruža napredne režime za naučne, "
"statističke i numeričke proračune sistema."

#. Tag: keyword
#: index.docbook:48
#, no-c-format
msgid "<keyword>KDE</keyword>"
msgstr "<keyword>KDE</keyword>"

#. Tag: keyword
#: index.docbook:49
#, no-c-format
msgid "KCalc"
msgstr "KCalc"

#. Tag: keyword
#: index.docbook:50
#, no-c-format
msgid "calculator"
msgstr "kalkulator"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:55
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Uvod"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:57
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kcalc; offers many more mathematical functions than meet the eye on a first "
"glance. Please study the section on keyboard accelerators and modes in this "
"handbook to learn more about the many functions available."
msgstr ""
"&kcalc; nudi mnogo više matematičkih funkcija nego što se čini na prvi "
"pogled. Molimo vas da proučite poglavlje o akceleratorima tastature i režima "
"u ovom priručniku da biste saznali više o mnogim funkcijama na raspolaganju."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:62
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In addition to the usual functionality offered by most scientific "
"calculators, &kcalc; offers a number of features, which I think are "
"worthwhile pointing out:"
msgstr ""
"Pored uobičajene funkcionalnosti koje nudi većina naučnih kalkulatora,  "
"&kcalc; nudi veliki broj funkcija, za koji mislim da se isplati istaknuti:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:68
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kcalc; provides trigonometric functions, logic operations, and it is able "
"to do statistical calculations."
msgstr ""
"&kcalc; pruža trigonometrijske funkcije, logičke operacije, a može da vrši i "
"statističke proračune."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:72
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kcalc; allows you to cut and paste numbers from/into its display."
msgstr ""
"&kcalc; vam omogućava da izrežete i zalijepite brojeve iz /u njegov ekran."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:75
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kcalc; features a <firstterm>results-stack</firstterm> which lets you "
"conveniently recall previous results."
msgstr ""
"&kcalc; ima <firstterm>results-stack</firstterm> koja vam omogućava "
"jednostavno pozovanje prethodnih rezultata."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:79
#, no-c-format
msgid "You can configure &kcalc;'s display colors and font."
msgstr "Možete konfigurisati &kcalc;  boje ekrana i font."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:82
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can configure &kcalc;'s precision, the number of displayed digits and "
"the number of digits after the period in the settings dialog."
msgstr ""
"Možete konfigurisati &kcalc; preciznost, broj prikazanih cifri i broj cifri "
"nakon decimalne tačke u dijalogu postavki."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:86
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kcalc; offers a great number of useful <link linkend=\"key-accels\"> key-"
"bindings</link>, which make using &kcalc; without using a pointing device "
"easy."
msgstr ""
"&kcalc; nudi veliki broj korisnih <link linkend=\"key-accels\"> ključnih-"
"vezova </link>, koje čine koristeći &kcalc; bez upotrebe pokazivačkih "
"uređaja."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:88
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Hint: pressing (and holding) the &Ctrl;-key, displays on every button,the "
"corresponding key-binding."
msgstr ""
"Hint: pritiskom (i držanjem)  &Ctrl;-tipke, prikazuje na svakom dugmetu, "
"odgovarajuću veznu tipku."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:94
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kcalc; uses <ulink url=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Calculator_input_methods#Infix_notation\">Infix notation</ulink> which "
"enforces correct order of operations as taught in school; contrary to <ulink "
"url=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Calculator_input_methods#Immediate_execution\">Immediate execution</ulink> "
"used by many simple calculators."
msgstr ""
"&kcalc; koristi <ulink url=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Calculator_input_methods#Infix_notation\">Infix notation</ulink>koji nameće "
"ispravni redoslijed operacija kao što se učilo u školi;  suprotno <ulink url="
"\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Calculator_input_methods#Immediate_execution"
"\">Immediate execution</ulink> se koristi od strane mnogih jednostavnih "
"kalkulatora."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:100
#, no-c-format
msgid "Have fun with &kcalc;!"
msgstr "Zabavite se sa &kcalc;!"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:102
#, no-c-format
msgid "&Bernd.Johannes.Wuebben;"
msgstr "&Bernd.Johannes.Wuebben;"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:108
#, no-c-format
msgid "Usage"
msgstr "Upotreba"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:110
#, no-c-format
msgid "General Usage"
msgstr "Opšta upotreba"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:112
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"General usage is straight forward and similar to the way most simple "
"scientific calculators operate, but take note of the following special "
"&kcalc; features:"
msgstr ""
"Opšta upotreba je jednostavna i slična načinu na koji najjednostavniji "
"naučni kalkulatori rade, ali uzmite u obzir sljedeće posebne &kcalc; "
"karakteristike:"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:118
#, no-c-format
msgid "Result Stack"
msgstr "Rezultujući stek"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:119
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Each time you &LMB; click on the <guibutton>=</guibutton> button or press "
"your keyboard's &Enter; or <keysym>=</keysym> keys, the display result is "
"written to &kcalc;'s result stack. You can navigate through the result stack "
"with your keyboard's <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>Z</keycap></"
"keycombo> and <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl; &Shift;<keycap>Z</keycap></"
"keycombo> keys."
msgstr ""
"Svaki put kada vi &LMB; kliknite na <guibutton> = </guibutton> dugme ili "
"pritisnite &Enter; sa vaše tastature ili <keysym> = </keysym> tipke, prikaz "
"rezultata je napisan na &kcalc; 's rezultatnom steku. Možete se kretati kroz "
"rezultantni stek sa svojim tipkama na tastaturi <keycombo action=\"simul\"> "
"&Ctrl; <keycap>Z</keycap></keycombo> i <keycombo action = \"simul\"> &Ctrl; "
"&Shift; <keycap>Z</keycap></keycombo> tipkama."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:131
#, no-c-format
msgid "Percent Function"
msgstr "Funkcija Postotka"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:133
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The percent function works somewhat differently to that on most calculators. "
"However, once understood, its enhanced functionality proves quite useful. "
"See the section about the <link linkend=\"percent\">percent</link> function "
"for further details."
msgstr ""
"Funkcija postotka radi nešto drugačije od toga na većini kalkulatora. "
"Međutim, njegova poboljšana funkcionalnost pokazuje se vrlo korisnom. "
"Pogledajte poglavlje o <link linkend=\"percent\">percent</link> funkciji za "
"više detalja."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:140
#, no-c-format
msgid "Cut and Paste"
msgstr "Izreži i Zalijepi"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:144
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Pressing <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>C</keycap></keycombo> will "
"place the displayed number on to the clipboard."
msgstr ""
"Pritiskom <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>C</keycap></keycombo> "
"smjestiti će prikazani broj na clipboard(ostavu)."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:148
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Pressing <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>V</keycap></keycombo> will "
"paste the clipboard content into the display if the content of the clipboard "
"is a valid floating point number."
msgstr ""
"Pritiskom <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>V</keycap></keycombo> "
"zalijepiti će clipboard (sadržaj iz ostave) na ekran, ako je sadržaj "
"clipboard-a važeći broj sa pomičnim zarezom."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:153
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"It is still possible to copy/paste by clicking on &kcalc;'s display, but "
"this may disappear in future versions."
msgstr ""
"Još uvijek je moguće kopirati/zalijepiti klikom na &kcalc; 's prikaz, ali to "
"može nestati u budućim verzijama."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:160
#, no-c-format
msgid "Advanced functions"
msgstr "Napredne Funkcije"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:162
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you start &kcalc; for the first time, the calculator will only display "
"buttons for basic arithmetic computations."
msgstr ""
"Kada pokrenete &kcalc; po prvi put, kalkulator će prikazati samo dugmad za "
"osnovne aritmetičke izračune."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:164
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Under the menu entry <guimenu>Settings</guimenu> it is possible to select a "
"mode for &kcalc;: it is possible to choose <link linkend=\"simple-mode"
"\">Simple</link> or <link linkend=\"science-mode\">Science</link> or <link "
"linkend=\"statistical-mode\">Statistic</link> or <link linkend=\"numeral-"
"system-mode\">Numeral System</link> mode. Please note, that these modes will "
"slightly change as &kcalc; evolves."
msgstr ""
"Prema opcijama izbornika <guimenu>Postavke</guimenu> moguće je odabrati "
"režim za &kcalc;: moguće je odabrati <link linkend =\"simple-mode\"> "
"Jednostavni </link> ili <link linkend = \"scende-mode \"> Naučni</link> ili "
"<link linkend =\" statistical-mode \"> Statistički </link> ili <link linkend "
"=\" numeral-system-mode \">  Brojčani Sistem </link> režime.  Imajte na umu, "
"da će se ovi načini nešto promijeniti, buduć da se &kcalc; razvija."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:175
#, no-c-format
msgid "Button Layout"
msgstr "Raspored dugmadi"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:177
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To give easy access to all the functions in advanced modes in &kcalc;, many "
"keys have a second layout. Click on <guibutton>&Shift;</guibutton> or press "
"the shortcut <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>2</keycap></keycombo> "
"to make the second layout of the buttons visible."
msgstr ""
"Da bi bio lagan pristup svim funkcijama u naprednim režimima u &kcalc;, "
"mnoge tipke imaju drugi raspored. Kliknite na <guibutton> &Shift; </"
"guibutton> ili pritisnite prečicu <keycombo action = \"simul\"> &Ctrl; "
"<keycap>2</keycap></keycombo> da bi drugi raspored tipki postao vidljiv."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:190
#, no-c-format
msgid "Simple Mode"
msgstr "Jednostavni režim"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:191
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This mode contains only those buttons and functions, which are essential "
"necessary for basic calculations."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj režim sadrži samo one tipke i funkcije, koje su suštinski neophodne za "
"osnovne proračune."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:192
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you just want to sum up all items on an invoice this mode may be your "
"choice."
msgstr ""
"Ako samo želite da sumirate sve stavke na fakturi, ovaj režim može biti vaš "
"izbor."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:197
#, no-c-format
msgid "Science Mode"
msgstr "Naučni režim"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:199
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In this mode the left column of buttons is allocated to trigonometric "
"functions:"
msgstr ""
"U ovom režimu lijevoj koloni tipki su dodijeljene trigonometrijske funkcije:"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:204 index.docbook:248 index.docbook:309 index.docbook:367
#, no-c-format
msgid "Buttons"
msgstr "Dugmad"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:205 index.docbook:249 index.docbook:310 index.docbook:368
#: index.docbook:502
#, no-c-format
msgid "Function"
msgstr "Funkcija"

#. Tag: guibutton
#: index.docbook:208 index.docbook:508
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guibutton>Hyp</guibutton>"
msgstr "<guibutton>Hyp</guibutton>"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:209
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Enter Hyperbolic sub mode. Hyp Sin for example is the hyperbolic sine: sinh"
msgstr ""
"Unesite hiperbolni podrežim. Hyp Sin je naprimjer hiperbolni sinus: sinh"

#. Tag: guibutton
#: index.docbook:212 index.docbook:513
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guibutton>Sin</guibutton>"
msgstr "<guibutton>Sinus</guibutton>"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:213
#, no-c-format
msgid "Compute the sine"
msgstr "Izračunati sinus"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:215
#, no-c-format
msgid "&Shift; <guibutton>Sin</guibutton> or <guibutton>Asin</guibutton>"
msgstr ""
"&Shift; <guibutton>Sinus</guibutton> ili <guibutton>Arkussinus</guibutton>"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:216
#, no-c-format
msgid "Compute the inverse sine"
msgstr "Izražunati arkus sinus"

#. Tag: guibutton
#: index.docbook:218 index.docbook:517
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guibutton>Cos</guibutton>"
msgstr "<guibutton>Kosinus</guibutton>"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:219
#, no-c-format
msgid "Compute the cosine"
msgstr "Izračunati kosinu"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:221
#, no-c-format
msgid "&Shift; <guibutton>Cos</guibutton> or <guibutton>Acos</guibutton>"
msgstr ""
"&Shift; <guibutton>Kosinus</guibutton> ili <guibutton>Arkuskosinus</"
"guibutton>"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:222
#, no-c-format
msgid "Compute the inverse cosine"
msgstr "Izračunati arkus kosinus"

#. Tag: guibutton
#: index.docbook:224 index.docbook:521
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guibutton>Tan</guibutton>"
msgstr "<guibutton>Tangens</guibutton>"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:225
#, no-c-format
msgid "Compute the tangent"
msgstr "Izračunati tangens"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:227
#, no-c-format
msgid "&Shift; <guibutton>Tan</guibutton> or <guibutton>Atan</guibutton>"
msgstr ""
"&Shift; <guibutton>Tangens</guibutton> ili <guibutton>Arkustangens</"
"guibutton>"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:228
#, no-c-format
msgid "Compute the inverse tangent"
msgstr "Izračunati arkus tangens"

#. Tag: guibutton
#: index.docbook:230 index.docbook:529
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guibutton>Log</guibutton>"
msgstr "<guibutton>Logaritam</guibutton>"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:231
#, no-c-format
msgid "Compute the Log base 10"
msgstr "Izračunati logaritam po bazi 10"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:233
#, no-c-format
msgid "&Shift; <guibutton>Log</guibutton> or 10<superscript>x</superscript>"
msgstr ""
"&Shift; <guibutton>Logaritam</guibutton> ili 10<superscript>x</superscript>"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:234
#, no-c-format
msgid "Compute 10 to the power of x"
msgstr "Izračunati 10 na potenciju x"

#. Tag: guibutton
#: index.docbook:236 index.docbook:525
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guibutton>Ln</guibutton>"
msgstr "<guibutton>Prirodni logaritam</guibutton>"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:237
#, no-c-format
msgid "Compute the natural logarithm. That is the log to base e"
msgstr "Izračunati prirodni logaritam. To je logaritam po bazi e."

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:239
#, no-c-format
msgid "&Shift; <guibutton>Ln</guibutton> or e<superscript>x</superscript>"
msgstr ""
"&Shift; <guibutton>Prirodni logaritam</guibutton> ili e<superscript>x</"
"superscript>"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:240
#, no-c-format
msgid "Compute e (the base of the natural logarithm) to the power of x"
msgstr "Izračunati e(baza prirodnog logaritma) na potenciju x"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:244
#, no-c-format
msgid "The second column has buttons for algebraic functions:"
msgstr "Druga kolona ima dugmad za algebarske funkcije:"

#. Tag: guibutton
#: index.docbook:252 index.docbook:626
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guibutton>Mod</guibutton>"
msgstr "<guibutton>Ostatak</guibutton>"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:253
#, no-c-format
msgid "Compute the remainder in Euclidean division"
msgstr "Izračunati ostatak u Euclidean-ovom dijeljenju:"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:255
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guibutton>&Shift;</guibutton> <guibutton>Mod</guibutton> or "
"<guibutton>IntDiv</guibutton>"
msgstr ""
"<guibutton>&Shift;</guibutton> <guibutton>Ostatak</guibutton> ili "
"<guibutton>CjelobrojnoDjeljenje</guibutton>"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:256
#, no-c-format
msgid "Integer division (integer part of the quotient)"
msgstr "Cjelobrojno dijeljenje(cijeli dio količnika)"

#. Tag: guibutton
#: index.docbook:258 index.docbook:586
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guibutton>1/x</guibutton>"
msgstr "<guibutton>1/x</guibutton>"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:259
#, no-c-format
msgid "Compute the reciprocal for a number"
msgstr "Izračunati recipročnu vrijednost za broj"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:261
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guibutton>&Shift;</guibutton> <guibutton>1/x</guibutton> or <guibutton>nCm</"
"guibutton>"
msgstr ""
"<guibutton>&Shift;</guibutton> <guibutton>1/x</guibutton> ili "
"<guibutton>nCm</guibutton>"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:262
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Compute the number of distinct second-operand-element subsets of it that can "
"be formed for any set containing first operand elements (binomial "
"coefficient)"
msgstr ""
"Izračunati broj različitih elemenata drugih operanada podskupova, koji mogu "
"biti formirani za bilo skup koji sadrži elemente prvog operanda (binomni "
"koeficijent)"

#. Tag: guibutton
#: index.docbook:264 index.docbook:550
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guibutton>x!</guibutton>"
msgstr "<guibutton>x!</guibutton>"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:265
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Compute the product of all positive integers less than or equal to the "
"current integer operand (factorial)"
msgstr ""
"Izračunati proizvod svih pozitivnih cijelobrojnih vrijednosti manjih ili "
"jednakih trenutnom cjelobrojnom operandu (faktorijelu)"

#. Tag: guibutton
#: index.docbook:267
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guibutton>x²</guibutton>"
msgstr "<guibutton>x²</guibutton>"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:268
#, no-c-format
msgid "Compute the square of x"
msgstr "Izračunati  kvadrat od x"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:270
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guibutton>&Shift;</guibutton> <guibutton>x²</guibutton> or <guibutton>√x</"
"guibutton>"
msgstr ""
"<guibutton>&Shift;</guibutton> <guibutton>x²</guibutton> ili<guibutton>√x</"
"guibutton>"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:271
#, no-c-format
msgid "Compute the square root of x"
msgstr "Izračunati kvadratni korjen od x"

#. Tag: guibutton
#: index.docbook:273
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guibutton>xʸ</guibutton>"
msgstr "<guibutton>xʸ</guibutton>"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:274
#, no-c-format
msgid "x power y"
msgstr "x na potenciju y"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:276
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&Shift; x<superscript>y</superscript> or x<superscript>1/y</superscript>"
msgstr ""
"&Shift; x<superscript>y</superscript> ili x<superscript>1/y</superscript>"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:277
#, no-c-format
msgid "x power 1/y"
msgstr "x na potenciju recipročne vrijednosti od y"

#. Tag: guibutton
#: index.docbook:279
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guibutton>x³</guibutton>"
msgstr "<guibutton>x³</guibutton>"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:280
#, no-c-format
msgid "Computes the third (cubic) power of x"
msgstr "Računa x na potenciju 3"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:282
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guibutton>&Shift;</guibutton> <guibutton>x³</guibutton> or <guibutton>∛x</"
"guibutton>"
msgstr ""
"<guibutton>&Shift;</guibutton> <guibutton>x³</guibutton> ili <guibutton>∛x</"
"guibutton>"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:283
#, no-c-format
msgid "Computes the third (cubic) root of x"
msgstr "Računa treći korijen broja x"

#. Tag: guibutton
#: index.docbook:285
#, no-c-format
msgid "x·10ʸ"
msgstr "x·10ʸ"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:286
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Computes the product of the first operand and decimal exponent of the second "
"operand"
msgstr ""
"Izračunava proizvod prvog operanda i decimalnog eksponenta drugog operanda"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:294
#, no-c-format
msgid "Statistical Mode"
msgstr "Statistički režim"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:296
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In this mode the left column of buttons is allocated to statistical "
"functions:"
msgstr ""
"U ovom režimu lijevoj koloni tipki su dodijeljene statističke funkcije:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:298
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Most of the functionality in this mode is centered around the "
"<guibutton>Dat</guibutton> button. To create a data list of numbers, enter a "
"number into the calculator and press <guibutton>Dat</guibutton>. A "
"sequentially increasing number is shown on the display indicating which "
"position in the Data <quote>list</quote> the number occupies. A traditional "
"calculator only stores three values for statistical functions: The number of "
"discrete items in a list, the sum of the data items entered and the sum of "
"the square of all data items in the list. &kcalc; differs by actually "
"storing each discrete value, allowing you to calculate the median value of "
"the data."
msgstr ""
"Većina funkcionalnosti u ovom režimu je centrirano oko <guibutton> Dat </"
"guibutton>. Da biste napravili listu podataka brojeva, unesite broj u "
"kalkulator i pritisnite <guibutton> Dat </guibutton>.  Sekvencijalno veći "
"broj koji je prikazan na ekranu ukazuje koju poziciju u podacima <quote> "
"Lista </quote> broj zauzima. Tradicionalni kalkulator spašava samo tri "
"vrijednosti za statističke funkcije: Broj diskretne stavke na listi, zbir "
"stavki podataka koji se upisuju i zbir kvadrata svih stavki podataka na "
"listi. &kcalc; razlikuje se po čuvanju svake diskretne vrijednosti, što vam "
"omogućava da izračunate srednje vrijednosti podataka."

#. Tag: guibutton
#: index.docbook:313
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guibutton>N</guibutton>"
msgstr "<guibutton>N</guibutton>"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:314
#, no-c-format
msgid "Recall the number of data items entered"
msgstr "Prikaži broj upisanih podataka"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:316
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guibutton>&Shift;</guibutton> <guibutton>N</guibutton> or <guibutton>&Sgr;"
"x</guibutton>"
msgstr ""
"<guibutton>&Shift;</guibutton> <guibutton>N</guibutton> ili <guibutton>&Sgr;"
"x</guibutton>"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:317
#, no-c-format
msgid "Display the sum of all data items entered"
msgstr "Prikaz zbira svih unesenih podataka"

#. Tag: guibutton
#: index.docbook:319
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guibutton>Mea</guibutton>"
msgstr "<guibutton>SrednjaVrijednost</guibutton>"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:320
#, no-c-format
msgid "Display the mean of the data items entered"
msgstr "Prikaz srednje vrijendosti unesenih podataka"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:322
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guibutton>&Shift;</guibutton> <guibutton>Mea</guibutton> or <guibutton>&Sgr;"
"x²</guibutton>"
msgstr ""
"<guibutton>&Shift;</guibutton> <guibutton>Prosjek</guibutton> or "
"<guibutton>&Sgr;x²</guibutton>"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:323
#, no-c-format
msgid "Display the sum of the square of all data items entered"
msgstr "Prikaz zbira kvadrata unesenih podataka"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:325
#, no-c-format
msgid "&sgr;<subscript>N</subscript>"
msgstr "&sgr;<subscript>N</subscript>"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:326
#, no-c-format
msgid "Display the standard deviation (n)"
msgstr "Prikazuje standardnu devijaciju (n)"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:328
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guibutton>&Shift;</guibutton> &sgr;<subscript>N</subscript> or &sgr;"
"<subscript>N-1</subscript>"
msgstr ""
"<guibutton>&Shift;</guibutton> &sgr;<subscript>N</subscript> ili &sgr;"
"<subscript>N-1</subscript>"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:329
#, no-c-format
msgid "Display the population standard deviation (n-1)"
msgstr "Prikazuje standardnu devijaciju populacije (n-1)"

#. Tag: guibutton
#: index.docbook:331
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guibutton>Med</guibutton>"
msgstr "<guibutton>Medijan</guibutton>"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:332
#, no-c-format
msgid "Display the median"
msgstr "Prikazuje medijan"

#. Tag: guibutton
#: index.docbook:334 index.docbook:577
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guibutton>Dat</guibutton>"
msgstr "<guibutton>Dat</guibutton>"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:335
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enter a data item"
msgstr "Unesite podatak"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:337
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guibutton>&Shift;</guibutton> <guibutton>Dat</guibutton> or "
"<guibutton>CDat</guibutton>"
msgstr ""
"<guibutton>&Shift;</guibutton> <guibutton>Podatak</guibutton> ili "
"<guibutton>CPodatak</guibutton>"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:338
#, no-c-format
msgid "Clear last data item entered"
msgstr "Obriši zadnji uneseni podatak"

#. Tag: guibutton
#: index.docbook:340
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guibutton>CSt</guibutton>"
msgstr "<guibutton>CSt</guibutton>"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:341
#, no-c-format
msgid "Clear the store of all data item entered"
msgstr "Obriši sve unesene podatke"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:345
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The next two columns hold the buttons with trigonometric and algebraic "
"functions described in the <link linkend=\"science-mode\">Science</link> "
"mode section."
msgstr ""
"Naredne dvije kolone čuvaju tipke sa trigonometrijskim i algebarskim "
"funkcijama opisanih u <link linkend = \"science-mode\"> Nauka </link> režimu."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:352
#, no-c-format
msgid "Numeral System Mode"
msgstr "Način rada brojnih sistema"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:353
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This mode contains buttons and functions to calculate in binary, "
"hexadecimal, octal and decimal."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj režim sadrži tipke i funkcije za izračunavanje u binarnom, "
"heksadecimalnom, oktalnom i decimalnom sistemu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:355
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You select the numeral system with the radio buttons on the right. To insert "
"a hexadecimal number for example, just do the following: Select "
"<guilabel>Hex</guilabel> from the radio buttons. Then enter a number and "
"note, that you can use the letters <guibutton>A</guibutton> to <guibutton>F</"
"guibutton> for numbers larger than 9. If you would like to see this number "
"in binary, just select <guilabel>Bin</guilabel> from the radio buttons."
msgstr ""
"Možete odabrati broj sistem sa radio dugmadima na desnoj strani. Za unošenje "
"heksadecimalnog broja naprimjer, samo uradite sljedeće: Odaberite <guilabel> "
"Hex </guilabel> radio dugme.  Zatim unesite broj i notaciju, da možete "
"koristiti slova <guibutton>A</guibutton> na <guibutton>F</guibutton> za "
"brojeve veće od 9. Ako želite vidjeti ovaj broj u binarnom sistemu, samo "
"odaberite <guilabel> Bin </guilabel>radio dugme."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:360
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Binary, octal and hexadecimal numbers can be displayed as groups of digits "
"separated by whitespaces. Such grouping can improve readability of numbers. "
"For example, hexadecimal number <emphasis>AF1C42</emphasis> can be displayed "
"as <emphasis>AF 1C 42</emphasis> with separation every second digit. "
"Grouping can be turned off or tweaked. Select <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure &kcalc;...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> to "
"bring up the configuration dialog and change the setting on "
"<guilabel>General</guilabel> page as appropriate."
msgstr ""
"Binarni, oktalni i heksadecimalni brojevi se mogu prikazati kao grupa cifri "
"koje su odvojene razmacima. Takvo grupiranje može poboljšati čitljivost "
"brojeva. Na primjer, heksadecimalni broj <emphasis> AF1C42 </emphasis> može "
"se prikazati kao <emphasis> AF 1C 42 </emphasis> sa razdvajanjem svake druge "
"cifre. Grupiranje se može isključiti ili izmjenjeno. Odaberite <menuchoice> "
"<guimenu> Postavke </guimenu> <guimenuitem> Konfiguracija &kcalc; ... </"
"guimenuitem> </menuchoice> da bi se pojavila u dijalogu za podešavanje i "
"promijenite postavke na <guilabel>General</guilabel> stranice kao "
"odgovarajuće."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:362
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You may want to select <guimenu>Show Bit Edit</guimenu> from the "
"<guimenu>Settings</guimenu> menu to see selected bits."
msgstr ""
"Možda želite da izaberete <guimenu> Show Bit Edit </guimenu> od <guimenu> "
"Postavke </guimenu> da vidite odabrane bite."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:364
#, no-c-format
msgid "There are logic operators available in this mode. These operators are:"
msgstr "Postoje logički operatori dostupni u ovom režimu. Ovi operatori su:"

#. Tag: guibutton
#: index.docbook:370 index.docbook:565
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guibutton>AND</guibutton>"
msgstr "<guibutton>I</guibutton>"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:371
#, no-c-format
msgid "Two numbers are logically anded"
msgstr "Dva broja su logički pomnožena"

#. Tag: guibutton
#: index.docbook:373 index.docbook:581
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guibutton>OR</guibutton>"
msgstr "<guibutton>ILI</guibutton>"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:374
#, no-c-format
msgid "Two numbers are logically ored"
msgstr "Dva broja su logički sabrana"

#. Tag: guibutton
#: index.docbook:376
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guibutton>XOR</guibutton>"
msgstr "<guibutton>EkskluzivnoILI</guibutton>"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:377
#, no-c-format
msgid "Two numbers are logically exclusive ored"
msgstr "Dva broja su ekskluzivno sabrana"

#. Tag: guibutton
#: index.docbook:379 index.docbook:558
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guibutton>Lsh</guibutton>"
msgstr "<guibutton>Lsh</guibutton>"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:380
#, no-c-format
msgid "Left shift the value"
msgstr "Šiftaj lijevo vrijednost"

#. Tag: guibutton
#: index.docbook:382 index.docbook:562
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guibutton>Rsh</guibutton>"
msgstr "<guibutton>Rsh</guibutton>"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:383
#, no-c-format
msgid "Right shift the value"
msgstr "Šiftaj desno vriejdnost"

#. Tag: guibutton
#: index.docbook:385
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guibutton>Cmp</guibutton>"
msgstr "<guibutton>Cmp</guibutton>"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:386
#, no-c-format
msgid "Perform a 1's complement"
msgstr "Izvrši 1. komplement"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:391
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The second column holds the buttons with algebraic functions described in "
"the <link linkend=\"science-mode\">Science</link> mode section."
msgstr ""
"Druga kolona sadrži tipke sa algebarskim funkcijama opisane u <link linkend "
"= \"science-mode\"> Nauka </link> režimu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:394
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The third column with the buttons <guibutton>A</guibutton> to <guibutton>F</"
"guibutton> is enabled only in <guilabel>Hex</guilabel> mode."
msgstr ""
"Treća kolona  s dugmadima <guibutton> A </guibutton> na <guibutton>F</"
"guibutton> je omogućena samo u <guilabel> Hex </guilabel> režimu."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:403
#, no-c-format
msgid "Memory Operations"
msgstr "Memorijske Operacije"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:405
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kcalc; supports the memory operations given by standard calculators plus "
"six slots to hold constants."
msgstr ""
"&kcalc; podržava memorijske operacije koje su dali standardni kalkulatori "
"plus šest mjesta za čuvanje konstante."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:409
#, no-c-format
msgid "Standard Memory Operations"
msgstr "Standardne Memorijeske Operacije"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:411
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kcalc; can remember results of operations for you, and re-use them in later "
"calculations. You can access these functions via several buttons labeled "
"<guibutton>MR</guibutton>, <guibutton>MS</guibutton>, <guibutton>M+</"
"guibutton> and <guibutton>MC</guibutton>."
msgstr ""
"&kcalc; mogu da memorišu rezultate operacija za vas, i da ih ponovo koriste "
"u kasnijim proračunima. Možete pristupiti ovim funkcijama preko nekoliko "
"dugmadi oznakom <guibutton> MR </guibutton>, <guibutton> MS </guibutton>, "
"<guibutton> M + </guibutton> i <guibutton> MC </guibutton>."

#. Tag: guibutton
#: index.docbook:418
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guibutton>MS</guibutton>"
msgstr "<guibutton>MS</guibutton>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:419
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guibutton>MS</guibutton> button stores the currently displayed result "
"in memory."
msgstr ""
"<guibutton>MS</guibutton> dugme pohranjuje trenutno prikazani rezultat u "
"memoriju."

#. Tag: guibutton
#: index.docbook:424
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guibutton>M+</guibutton>"
msgstr "<guibutton>M+</guibutton>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:425
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guibutton>M+</guibutton> button adds the current result to the one in "
"memory. So, if you had stored a 20, and the current result is a 5, your "
"memory would contain 25 when you press it. If the memory is empty, it acts "
"like <guibutton>MS</guibutton> and simply stores the result."
msgstr ""
"<guibutton> M+ </guibutton> dugme dodaje trenutni rezultat već postojećem u "
"memoriji. Dakle, ako ste već pohranili 20, a trenutni rezultat je 5, vaša "
"memorija bi sadržavala 25 nakon što pritisnete dugme. Ako je memorija "
"prazna, ponaša se kao <guibutton> MS </guibutton> i jednostavno pohranjuje "
"rezultat."

#. Tag: guibutton
#: index.docbook:433
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guibutton>MR</guibutton>"
msgstr "<guibutton>MR</guibutton>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:434
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guibutton>MR</guibutton> button gets the value stored in memory and "
"puts it in the display."
msgstr ""
"<guibutton>MR</guibutton> dugme uzima pohranjenu vrijednost iz memorije i "
"stavlja je na ekran."

#. Tag: guibutton
#: index.docbook:439
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guibutton>MC</guibutton>"
msgstr "<guibutton>MC</guibutton>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:440
#, no-c-format
msgid "The <guibutton>MC</guibutton> button clears the memory."
msgstr "<guibutton>MC</guibutton> dugme oslobađa memoriju."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:445
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If a value is stored in memory a <guilabel>M</guilabel> will appear in the "
"status bar, next to the calculator mode indicator"
msgstr ""
"Ako je vrijednost pohranjena u memoriji a <guilabel> M </guilabel> će se "
"pojaviti u statusnoj traci, pored indikatora režima kalkulatora"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:450
#, no-c-format
msgid "Constants"
msgstr "Konstante"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:452
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The six constants buttons <guibutton>C1</guibutton> to <guibutton>C6</"
"guibutton> will only be visible after activating the item "
"<guilabel>Constants Buttons</guilabel> in the menu <guimenu>Settings</"
"guimenu> of the menu bar. They are available in <guilabel>Science mode</"
"guilabel> and <guilabel>Statistics mode</guilabel>"
msgstr ""
"Šest konstantnih tipki od <guibutton> C1 </guibutton>  do <guibutton> C6 </"
"guibutton> će biti samo vidljivi nakon aktiviranja stavki "
"<guilabel>Constants Buttons</guilabel> u izborniku <guimenu> Postavke </"
"guimenu> sa trake izbornika. Oni su dostupni u <guilabel>Science mode</"
"guilabel> i <guilabel> Statistics mode</guilabel>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:458
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To see the value stored in each constant hover the button with the mouse "
"pointer."
msgstr ""
"Da biste vidjeli vrijednost koja je pohranjena u svakoj konstanti, kružite "
"pokazivačem miša po dugmetu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:460
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To store the number shown in the &kcalc; display in one of the six "
"constants, first press <guibutton>&Shift;</guibutton> followed by the "
"desired button key <guibutton>C1</guibutton> up to <guibutton>C6</guibutton>."
msgstr ""
"Za pohranjivanje broja prikazanog na &kcalc; ekranu u jednu od šest "
"konstanti, prvo pritisnite <guibutton> &Shift; </guibutton> zatim željeno "
"dugme <guibutton> C1 </guibutton> do <guibutton> C6 </guibutton>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:465
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To use the value stored in any of the constants in a calculation, just press "
"the desired button (<guibutton>C1</guibutton> to <guibutton>C6</guibutton>), "
"and the corresponding number will appear in the display."
msgstr ""
"Da biste koristili vrijednosti, pohranjene u bilo kojem od konstanti, u "
"proračunu, samo pritisnite željeno dugme (<guibutton> C1 </guibutton> do "
"<guibutton> C6 </guibutton>), i odgovarajući broj će se pojaviti na ekranu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:469
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"It is possible to change the label of the constants button to make it easier "
"to remember which button holds which constant. Click with the right mouse "
"button on one of the buttons <guibutton>C1</guibutton> to <guibutton> C6</"
"guibutton>. A popup menu appears, in which you select <guilabel> Set Name</"
"guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"Moguće je promijeniti natpis konstanti dugmeta kako bi lakše zapamtili koje "
"dugme koju konstantu čuva. Kliknite desnom tipkom miša na jedno od dugmadi "
"<guibutton> C1 </guibutton> do <guibutton> C6 </guibutton>. Pojavi se skočni "
"izbornik u kojem možete odabrati <guilabel> Set Name </guilabel>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:475
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"There are many (mostly physical) predefined constants, which can be put on "
"any of the six buttons <guibutton>C1</guibutton> - <guibutton>C6</guibutton> "
"by selecting the desired constant in the popup menu that appears after right "
"clicking on one of the constant buttons and selecting <guilabel>Choose from "
"List</guilabel>. Though the predefined constants can also be accessed via "
"the <guimenu>Constants</guimenu> in the menu bar, storing it on a constants "
"button is very handy, if the number is used frequently."
msgstr ""
"Postoji mnogo (uglavnom fizičkih) predefiniranih konstanti, koje se mogu "
"staviti na bilo koje od šest dugmadi<guibutton> C1 </guibutton> - "
"<guibutton> C6 </guibutton> odabirom željene konstante u skočnom izbornika "
"koji se pojavljuje nakon desnog klika na jedno od konstantnih dugmadi i "
"odabirom <guilabel> Choose from List </guilabel>. Iako se predefiniranim "
"konstantama može  pristupiti preko <guimenu> Constants </guimenu> u traci "
"izbornika, pohranjivanje na dugme konstanti je vrlo zgodno, ako je broj se "
"često koristi."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:490
#, no-c-format
msgid "Single Key Accelerators"
msgstr "Single Key Accelerators"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:492
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To simplify entering calculations from the keyboard &kcalc; has single key "
"accelerators for most functions. For example entering <userinput>7R</"
"userinput> or <userinput>7r</userinput> will calculate the reciprocal of 7 "
"(1/7)."
msgstr ""
"Kako bi se pojednostavio unos proračuna sa tastature &kcalc; ima single key "
"accelerators za većinu funkcija. Na primjer unošenjem <userinput> 7R </"
"userinput> ili <userinput>7sk</userinput> će izračunati recipročnu "
"vrijednost broja 7 (1/7)."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:496
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"During a computation, you can always press &Ctrl; to make each button "
"display its key-binding."
msgstr ""
"Tokom računanja, uvijek možete pritisnuti &Ctrl; da svako dugme prikaže "
"svoju vezu tipke."

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:501
#, no-c-format
msgid "<entry>Key</entry>"
msgstr "<entry>Key</entry>"

#. Tag: entry
#: index.docbook:503
#, no-c-format
msgid "Notes"
msgstr "Bilješke"

#. Tag: keycap
#: index.docbook:507
#, no-c-format
