#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:642
#, no-c-format
msgid "Mod and IntDiv"
msgstr "Ostatak i cijelobrojna vrijednost količnika"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:646
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guibutton>Mod</guibutton> gives the remainder of dividing the displayed "
"number by the next input number."
msgstr ""
"<guibutton>Ostatak</guibutton> daje ostatak dijeljenja prikazanog broj sa "
"sljedećim unesenim brojem."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:648
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<userinput>22 Mod 8 = </userinput> will give the result <emphasis>6</"
"emphasis>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>22 Mod 8 = </userinput> će dati rezultat <emphasis>6</emphasis>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:650
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<userinput>22.345 Mod 8 = </userinput> will give the result <emphasis>6.345</"
"emphasis>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>22.345 Mod 8 = </userinput> će dati rezultat <emphasis>6.345</"
"emphasis>"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:655
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guibutton>&Shift;</guibutton> <guibutton>IntDiv</guibutton> does integer "
"division of the displayed number by the next input number."
msgstr ""
"<guibutton>&Shift;</guibutton> <guibutton>IntDiv</guibutton> radi "
"cijelobrojno dijeljenje prikazanog broja sljedećim unesenim brojem."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:657
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<userinput>22 Shift IntDiv 8 = </userinput> will give the result "
"<emphasis>2</emphasis>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>22 Shift IntDiv 8 = </userinput> će dati rezultat <emphasis>2</"
"emphasis>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:659
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<userinput>22.345 Shift IntDiv 8 = </userinput> also gives <emphasis>2</"
"emphasis>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>22.345 Shift IntDiv 8 = </userinput> također daje <emphasis>2</"
"emphasis>"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:667
#, no-c-format
msgid "&percnt;"
msgstr "&percnt;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:669
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Used instead of the <guibutton>=</guibutton> key, <guibutton>%</guibutton> "
"interprets the final operation carried out in the current calculation as "
"follows:"
msgstr ""
"Korišteno umjesto <guibutton> = </guibutton> tipke, <guibutton>% </"
"guibutton> tumači finalnu funkciju izvršenu u trenutnoj funkciji kako "
"slijedi :"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:675
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If the final operator is + or - the second argument is interpreted as "
"percentage of the first operand."
msgstr ""
"Ako je krajnji operator + ili - drugi argument se tumači  kao postotak prvog "
"operanda."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:679
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If the final operator is * divide the result of the multiplication by 100."
msgstr "Ako je krajnji operator * podijeliti rezultat množenja sa 100."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:683
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If the final operator is / give the left operand as a percentage of the "
"right operand."
msgstr ""
"Ako je krajnji operator / dati lijevi operand kao procenat desnog operanda."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:688
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In all other cases the &percnt; key gives identical results to the = key."
msgstr ""
"U svim ostalim slučajevima &percnt; tipka daje identične rezultate kao = "
"tipka."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:695
#, no-c-format
msgid "Examples:"
msgstr "Primjeri:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:697
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<userinput>150 + 50 %</userinput> gives <emphasis>225</emphasis> (150 plus "
"50 percent of this amount)"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>150 + 50 %</userinput> daje <emphasis>225</emphasis> (150 plus 50 "
"posto od tog iznosa )"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:698
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<userinput>42 * 3 %</userinput> gives <emphasis>1.26</emphasis> (42 * 3 / "
"100)"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>42 * 3 %</userinput> daje<emphasis>1.26</emphasis> (42 * 3 / 100)"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:700
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<userinput>45 / 55 %</userinput> gives <emphasis>81.81...</emphasis> (45 is "
"81.81.. percent of 55)"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>45 / 55 %</userinput> daje<emphasis>81.81...</emphasis> (45 je "
"81.81.. procenat od 55)"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:709
#, no-c-format
msgid "Lsh and Rsh"
msgstr "Lsh and Rsh"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:712
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guibutton>Lsh</guibutton> left shifts the integer part of the displayed "
"value (multiplies it by 2) n times, where n is the next input number, and "
"gives an integer result (base is set to <guibutton>Bin</guibutton>):"
msgstr ""
"<guibutton> Lsh </guibutton> lijevo prebacuje cijeli dio od prikazane "
"vrijednosti (množi ga 2) n puta, gdje je n naredni broj koji se unosi i daje "
"rezultat cijeli broj (baza postavljena na <guibutton> Bin </guibutton>):"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:715
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<userinput>10 Lsh 3 =</userinput> gives <emphasis>80</emphasis> (10 "
"multiplied by 2 three times)."
msgstr ""
"<userinput>10 Lsh 3 =</userinput> daje <emphasis>80</emphasis> (10 pomnoženo "
"sa 2 tri puta)."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:717
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<userinput>10.345 Lsh 3 =</userinput> also gives <emphasis>80</emphasis>."
msgstr ""
"<userinput>10.345 Lsh 3 =</userinput> također daje <emphasis>80</emphasis>."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:722
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guibutton>Rsh</guibutton> right shifts the value (performs an integer "
"divide by 2) n times."
msgstr ""
"<guibutton>Rsh</guibutton> desno pomjera vrijednost (obavlja cjelobrojno "
"djeljenje sa 2) n puta."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:724
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<userinput>16 Rsh 2 =</userinput> gives <emphasis>4</emphasis> (16 divided "
"by 2 twice)."
msgstr ""
"<userinput>16 Rsh 2 =</userinput> daje <emphasis>4</emphasis> (16 podjeljeno "
"sa 2 dva puta)."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:726
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<userinput>16.999 Rsh 2 =</userinput> also gives <emphasis>4</emphasis>."
msgstr ""
"<userinput>16.999 Rsh 2 =</userinput> također daje <emphasis>4</emphasis>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:735
#, no-c-format
msgid "Cmp, And, Or and Xor"
msgstr "Poredi, I, ILI, i Xili"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:737
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guibutton>Cmp</guibutton>, <guibutton>And</guibutton> and "
"<guibutton>Or</guibutton> functions perform bitwise logical operations and "
"therefore appear more meaningful if the base is set to <guilabel>Hex</"
"guilabel>, <guilabel>Oct</guilabel> or <guilabel>Bin</guilabel> rather than "
"<guilabel>Dec</guilabel>. In the following examples base is set to "
"<guilabel>Bin</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"<guibutton> Cmp </guibutton>, <guibutton> i </guibutton> i <guibutton> ili </"
"guibutton> funkcije obavljaju bitwise logičke operacije i zbog toga se "
"izgledaju značajnije ako je baza postavljena na <guilabel> Hex </guilabel >, "
"<guilabel> Oct </guilabel> ili <guilabel> Bin </guilabel> umjesto <guilabel> "
"decembar </guilabel>. U sljedećim primjerima baze su postavljene na "
"<guilabel> Bin </guilabel>."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:746
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guibutton>Cmp</guibutton> performs a 1's complement (inverts the bits)."
msgstr "<guibutton>Cmp</guibutton> izvršava 1. komplement ( invertuje bite)."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:748
#, no-c-format
msgid "<userinput>101 Cmp</userinput> gives <emphasis>111...111010</emphasis>"
msgstr "<userinput>101 Cmp</userinput> daje<emphasis>111...111010</emphasis>"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:753
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guibutton>AND</guibutton> does a logical AND."
msgstr "<guibutton>AND</guibutton> je logičko \"I\"."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:754
#, no-c-format
msgid "<userinput>101 AND 110 =</userinput> gives <emphasis>100</emphasis>"
msgstr "<userinput>101 AND 110 =</userinput> daju <emphasis>100</emphasis>"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:759
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guibutton>OR</guibutton> does the logical OR."
msgstr "<guibutton>OR</guibutton> je logičko \"ILI\"."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:760
#, no-c-format
msgid "<userinput>101 OR 110 =</userinput> gives <emphasis>111</emphasis>"
msgstr "<userinput>101 OR 110 =</userinput> daje <emphasis>111</emphasis>"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:765
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guibutton>XOR</guibutton> performs the logical XOR (exclusive OR) operation."
msgstr ""
"<guibutton>XOR</guibutton> daje logičku XILI(ekskluzivnu ILI) operaciju."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:767
#, no-c-format
msgid "<userinput>101 XOR 110 =</userinput> gives <emphasis>11</emphasis>"
msgstr "<userinput>101 XOR 110 =</userinput> daje <emphasis>11</emphasis>"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:777
#, no-c-format
msgid "Questions and Answers"
msgstr "Pitanja i odgovori"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:783
#, no-c-format
msgid "How do I get e, the Euler number?"
msgstr "Kako dobijem e, Eulerov broj ?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:784
#, no-c-format
msgid "Type <userinput>1 Shift Ln</userinput>."
msgstr "Tip <userinput>1 Shift Ln</userinput>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:788
#, no-c-format
msgid "How do I get two fixed digits after the period?"
msgstr "Kako mogu dobiti 2 fiksne cifre nakon tačke?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:789
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Select <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guimenuitem> Configure "
"&kcalc;...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> on the menubar, this will bring up the "
"configuration dialog. Check <guilabel>Set decimal precision</guilabel> and "
"adjust the spin control so that it shows a 2."
msgstr ""
"Odaberite <menuchoice> <guimenu> Postavke </guimenu> <guimenuitem> "
"Konfiguracija &kcalc; ... </guimenuitem> </menuchoice> na traci menija, to "
"će dovesti dijalog za podešavanje. Provjerite <guilabel> Postavi decimalni "
"preciznošću </guilabel> i podesite spin kontrolu tako da pokazuje 2."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:796
#, no-c-format
msgid "What about Precision?"
msgstr "Šta je sa preciznošću?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:797
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The main factor determining the precision of &kcalc; is whether your libc "
"and libmath supports the C data type <type>long double</type>. If this is "
"the case, &kcalc; will detect this at compile time and use it as its "
"fundamental data type to represent numbers."
msgstr ""
"Glavni faktor koji određuje preciznost &kcalc; je da li vaš libc i libmath "
"podržava tip C podataka <tip> long double </tip>. Ako je to slučaj, &kcalc; "
"će otkriti za vrijeme prevođenja i koristiti ga kao svoj temeljni tip "
"podataka za predstavljanje brojeva."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:802
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Adjust the <guilabel>Precision</guilabel> in &kcalc;'s <guibutton>Configure</"
"guibutton> dialog so that the above computations work correctly. I recommend "
"a precision of 14 if the fundamental data type for your copy of &kcalc; is "
"<type>long double</type>, otherwise 8 or 10."
msgstr ""
"Prilagodite <guilabel> Preciznost </guilabel> u &kcalc;  <guibutton> "
"Konfiguriši </guibutton> dijalogu, tako da se gornji proračuni rade "
"ispravno. Preporučujem preciznost od 14 ako je temeljni tip podataka za vašu "
"kopiju &kcalc; <tip> long double </tip>, u suprotnom 8 ili 10."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:807
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Higher precision doesn't necessarily lead to better results. Play with the "
"precision and you will see what I mean."
msgstr ""
"Veća preciznost ne mora nužno dovesti do boljih rezultata. Igrajte se s "
"preciznošću i vidjet ćete šta mislim."

